<title>FRANCE: GAN H1 TURNOVER DROPS 11.5 PCT.</title>
<headline>GAN H1 TURNOVER DROPS 11.5 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					25,626    vs   28,967</p>
<p>	 Non-Life in France			7,227    vs    7,853</p>
<p>	 Life in France			   12,348    vs   13,421</p>
<p>	 GAN International			 6,051    vs    7,694</p>
<p>-- The company released the figures in the official Balo bulletin. It said that on a like for like basis, turnover dropped 6.9 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
